==Battleground==
*Infinite [[Squire Rel]]s spawn after 10 seconds<sup>300f</sup>, delay 5~10 seconds<sup>150f~300f</sup>.
*5 [[Squire Rel]]s spawn after 13.33 seconds<sup>400f</sup>, delay 6.67~10 seconds<sup>200f~300f</sup>.
*Infinite [[B.B.Bunny|B.B.Bunnies]] spawn after 20 seconds<sup>600f</sup>, delay 30~36.67 seconds<sup>900f~1,100f</sup>.
*3 [[Clyde Gory|Clyde Gories]] spawn after 46.67 seconds<sup>1,400f</sup>, delay 23.33~30 seconds<sup>700f~900f</sup>.
*2 [[Mooth]]s spawn after 56.67 seconds<sup>1,700f</sup>, delay 53.33~60 seconds<sup>1,600f~1,800f</sup>.
*3 [[Squire Rel]]s spawn after 60 seconds<sup>1,800f</sup>, delay 2~4 seconds<sup>60f~120f</sup>.
*4 [[Squire Rel]]s spawn after 80 seconds<sup>2,400f</sup>, delay 2~4 seconds<sup>60f~120f</sup>.
*3 [[Squire Rel]]s spawn after 100 seconds<sup>3,000f</sup>, delay 2~4 seconds<sup>60f~120f</sup>.
*1 [[Pinky Bear]] spawns as the boss after 6.67 seconds<sup>200f</sup>.

==Strategy==
A very easy stage that any unit can beat. Bring any of the [[:Category:Normal Cats|Normal Cats]] to win.

